&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgQ6Fq9yQUAzVgbEBnBiL3kg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZMmGAU668FhTVcYloSPFEb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlghJsTLbuJ8e2vib4s3R5ZQg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TsnhdjmINoy028xBmkMl9bkBgAg&quot;&gt;We are looking for a US-based Channels &amp;amp; Community Lead to help build our presence across Western crypto communities. This role will focus on building long-term relationships with KOLs, traders, community leaders, builders, and ecosystem partners, while also serving as a visible and credible voice in the Western Web3 market. The ideal candidate understands crypto-native culture, moves fast, builds trust naturally, and can turn relationships into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgsC78oc2hOIKL3YgsS6KTif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkszfklvZoDWAvsHTMSev7e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VtK8dL4g3onVj0xm8f9l6e4YgHb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain relationships with Western KOLs, traders, community leaders, builders, and ecosystem partners.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUyYdrqkyo1U58x6zTWlPGhBgTe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop a long-term network of high-quality channels across the US and broader Western crypto market.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpzEdecpOol8EMxAEiylwNJNgCd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify active and influential traders, creators, and community nodes in each market cycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J6ifdj0IaokpJux8xAOlccupg2g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support GTM for DEX, X Layer, Wallet, and other Web3 products through channel activation and community distribution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PIHgdep4fomE5ZxIGG8lSWDRgCc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive collaborations around new products, assets, campaigns, and ecosystem opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EZoGdUYlyomJOsxZNVulJWNVgac&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and operate Western community initiatives, including trader groups, ambassador programs, and local community partnerships.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZQedpA7gox1R0xrpT5ls05ggXd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as an external-facing voice for product updates, ecosystem developments, market opportunities, and community engagement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P8qOd8t04ocChfxpZWhlmO6Zgbb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work closely with Product, Growth, GTM, and Ecosystem teams to translate product capabilities into clear market narratives and distribution strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XDjAdadr9o8sXFxOXGplMLrCgOb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collect market and user feedback while maintaining strong judgment on what is strategically relevant.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CtoddlPZbofSbyxJWKSltHRNgmy&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track channel performance and contribute to user growth, trading volume, revenue, and long-term ecosystem retention.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
