descriptions.job-0otez0s:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a User Research Intern, you&#39;ll join our User Research team to help researchers, designers, and product managers understand user needs across products like Coinbase Cloud and developer tools. You&#39;ll tackle complex product problems, craft research reports that drive design and product decisions, and build foundational skills in UX research at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own one or more research projects alongside researchers, designers, and product managers to investigate a product problem or area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute research to solve complex, ambiguous product questions using appropriate methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver research reports that clearly communicate findings and provide actionable design and product recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teammates to translate user insights into thoughtful product experiences that help people engage with the crypto economy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively pursuing a career in user research through a degree in a research-related field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of general research principles (experimental design, bias, confounds) and UX research principles (usability testing, design thinking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to communicate research findings clearly, supported by a final report from a past research project (school, bootcamp, or extracurricular) uploaded with your application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of cryptocurrency and Coinbase&#39;s role in the crypto economy, with interest in learning more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
